lucid-wayland (0.1.0) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First packaged release, as liblucid-wayland-dev.
  * lucid-bar and lucid-panel vendored this as a git submodule. Packaging it
    means one copy of the toplevel source rather than one per consumer, and
    the two of them ending up on different revisions of it is no longer
    something that can happen quietly.

